  "content": "\n\n<hr />\n<p><em><strong>免責聲明：</strong></em></p>\n<p><em><strong>+ </strong></em>此資源包<strong>需要</strong><strong>Doggy Talents Next&nbsp;</strong><strong>才能運作！</strong>&nbsp;你可以在這裡找到該模組：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/doggy-talents-next\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/doggy-talents-next</a></p>\n<p><em>+ NWxDTN <strong>僅對安裝此資源包的玩家可見</strong>。否則，它將渲染為<strong>經典狼。</strong></em></p>\n<p><em>+ NWxDTN 與&nbsp;<strong>所有</strong> <strong>版本的 DTN</strong><strong>相容</strong>，即使 Minecraft 提示此資源包「不相容」。</em></p>\n<hr />\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em>受夠了等待 DTN 和 DTNP 更新了嗎？</em></p>\n\n<p><strong>隆重推出...</strong></p>\n<p>\n  <strong>\n    <img\n      src=\"https://github.com/DashieDev/DoggyTalentsNext/assets/122363761/31002f8d-bdef-4e34-87e0-a272e9f11644\"\n      alt=\"\"\n      width=\"500\"\n      height=\"500\"\n    />\n  </strong>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<h1><strong>🦴🐾 === New Wolves X Doggy Talents Next === 🐾🦴</strong></h1>\n<p><strong>你可以在任何安裝了 Doggy Talents Next 的伺服器上使用它！</strong></p>\n<p>\n  <strong>\n    此模組將 Minecraft 1.20.5 狼的所有特殊品種加入 Doggy Talents Next 模組作為可選皮膚，同時還包含來自 DTN 的其他罕見變體！\n  </strong>\n</p>\n\n<hr />\n<p>-------------🦴🐾<strong>如何存取皮膚</strong>🦴🐾-------------</p>\n<p>1. 蹲下點擊<a href=\"https://doggytalentsnext.wiki.gg/wiki/Getting_Started\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>已馴服的狗</strong></a>以開啟<strong>狗狗選單</strong>。</p>\n<p>2. 前往<strong>風格標籤頁 -> 皮膚</strong></p>\n<p>3. 新新增的皮膚位於列表最末尾（你也可以使用標籤搜尋功能）</p>\n<p>\n  <img\n    src=\"https://github.com/DashieDev/DoggyTalentsNext/assets/122363761/54930a78-809b-4f2c-ae38-3b8e9f5ca3d6\"\n    alt=\"Demo.gif\"\n    width=\"729\"\n    height=\"418\"\n  />\n</p>\n<p><em><strong>免責聲明：</strong></em></p>\n<p><em>+ NWxDTN 僅對安裝此資源包的玩家可見。否則，它將渲染為經典狼。</em></p>\n<p><em>+ 匯入此資源包時，Minecraft 可能會提示此資源包「不相容」。然而，它將與<strong>所有</strong>版本的 DTN 相容。</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr />\n<h3><strong><em>-------------🦴🐾看看其他作品！🦴🐾-------------</em></strong></h3>\n<p>\n    <strong><em>\n        <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/dtn-palette-of-paws\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" >\n            <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/694492/description_0039f023-ed37-4465-9f46-63f1cd5b8e2f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" />\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/doggy-talents-next\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" >\n            <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1051461/description_7a64ee81-714a-4c3b-b62e-7639eb4640db.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" />\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/better_dogs_x_doggy_talents_next\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" >\n            <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/694492/description_8a4bf69f-6bf6-4548-8600-8cf80637930b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" />\n        </a>\n        <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/doggy-talents-nexts-community-skin-expansion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" >\n            <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/694492/description_1be07a6a-255d-4595-b8c4-5da97eb95ba8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" />\n        </a>\n    </em></strong>\n</p>\n<ol>\n  <li><strong>Doggy Talents Next's Palette Of Paws</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>Doggy Talents Next</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>BetterDogs X DTN（客戶端）</strong></li>\n  <li><strong>Doggy Talents Next's Community Skin Expansion（客戶端）</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<hr />\n<p>遇到問題嗎？<strong>請在<strong><a href=\"https://github.com/DashieDev/DoggyTalentsNext/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github</a></strong>或我們的<a href=\"https://discord.gg/VnSkMufZEc\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a>上<strong>張貼所有問題和提問</strong>！</strong>這樣我們就能齊心協力、朝同一方向努力，讓工作變得更加順利！</p>\n<p>\n  <br />\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/VnSkMufZEc\" rel=\"nofollow\"\n    ><img\n      src=\"https://github.com/DashieDev/DoggyTalentsNext/assets/61554666/c9337b04-4f7f-4e72-b1fe-20629ed64e94\"\n      alt=\"\"\n      width=\"665\"\n      height=\"168\"\n    /></a\n  >\n</p>\n<p>我們還開設了一個<strong>YouTube 頻道</strong>：<strong><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCzeU2yIAywORQGXC_WieD8w\" rel=\"nofollow\">DoggyTalentsNextMod OFFICIAL</a></strong></p>\n<hr />\n<p><em>所有權利歸 Mojang Studios 所有。</em></p>",
